TITLE Mixing DIC and Ca solutions with calcite from 20C to 200C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      20
    pH        7.0     charge
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      50

SOLUTION 2
    temp      20
    pH        7.0     charge
    units     mmol/kgw
    Ca        50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

USER_PUNCH 1
    -head   Step   Temp   Calcite_moles
    -start
    10 Step = SIM_NO
    20 Temp = TC
    30 Calcite_moles = MOL("Calcite")
    40 PUNCH Step, Temp, Calcite_moles
    -end

END
